            <note corresp="#d104-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d104-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 66 D 347, CF 2548. Secret.
                    Drafted by Ford and approved by S on October 25.
                    The conversation was held at the Waldorf Towers. The source text is labeled
                    “Part 3 of 4.” Memoranda of conversation on NATO, the EEC, and a Dutch request
                    for military and nuclear technology are ibid.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
